    "en": {
      "text": "Fires seven bolts that deal impact damage and then explode after 5 seconds or when within 3 meters of an enemy. \n\nDue to repeated bugs and exploits, these bolts are immune to all forms of premature destruction.\n\nUpon detonation, each bolt deals <pve 236 /> <pvp [47] /> damage in a 4 meter radius, down to a minimum of 12.5% damage at the edge of the radius.",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-14T01:00:41.124Z",
      "updatedBy": "Hawkmoona"
    }
  },
