    "section": "Energy Slot Weapons",
    "snapshot": {
      "plain": "Void Sticky Fusion Rifle\n\nFires 7 sticky, proximity detonated bolts, each dealing up to 236 [47] Void Damage, down to 12.5% damage over 4 meters each.\nBolts last up to 5 seconds on surfaces, automatically detonate once an enemy is within 3 meters, and cannot be destroyed.\n\nScoring 3 Void Kills within 4.5 seconds of each triggers Harbinger's Pulse, fully refilling Telesto's Magazine.\nTelesto Kills count as 2 Kills.\n\n↑Deeper Pockets:\nPassively grants +3 Magazine Size (4 -> 7) and +40 Ammo Generation.\n\n↑Harbinger Seethe:\nHold [Reload] to smack Telesto, priming Harbinger Seethe once Harbinger's Pulse has been triggered 3 times.\nThe next direct hit creates a portal over the target that releases 22 Telesto bolts over 2.25 seconds.\nIncurs a 14 second cooldown after creating a portal before progress can be made again.",
